        [
          61.95494842529297,
          565.697021484375
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "(iii) Explanations often do not make sense, or do not provide enough detail to understand what the black\nbox is doing.",
      "heading_level": null,
      "page_id": 3,
      "polygon": [
        [
          61.685354232788086,
